  all tools\, guidance\, and instruction. Date: Friday\, November 20 from 1
 0:00AM - 2:00PM Trail Work Location: Ingles Field Gap Meetup Location: Led
 ford Parking Lot Work description: Clearing drains\, tread work\, and brus
 hing TCL: Craig Ruhland Required items: Long pants\, boots that cover your
  ankles\, safety glasses (can be provided)\, gloves (can be provided)\, ha
 rdhat (bike helmets DO NOT count\, but climbing helmets do\, and helmets c
 an be provided)\, snacks/lunch and water. All tools will be provided. Come
  out and give back to the trails!\n\nMore: https://www.pisgahareasorba.org
 /\n\nSource: Pisgah Area SORBA\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/ca
 lendar
